{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44669","headline":"壁上诗二首 一 · 丰干","name":"壁上诗二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"余自来天台，凡经几万回。\n一身如云水，悠悠任去来。\n逍遥绝无闹，忘机隆佛道。\n世途岐路心，衆生多烦恼。\n兀兀沈浪海，漂漂轮三界。\n可惜一灵物，无始被境埋。\n电光瞥然起，生死纷尘埃。\n寒山特相访，拾得常往来。\n论心话明月，太虚廓无碍。\n法界即无边，一法普徧该。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"丰干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44669.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44669","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}